1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
SOMEONE STOLE A SHARK…
IN A BABY STROLLER.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:10,000
HER NAME WAS
MISS HELEN.

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:16,000
THEY LIFTED HER FROM
THE OPEN TOUCH POOL.

4
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:22,000
THEN CAME A BUCKET
AND A WET BLANKET.

5
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:29,000
THE BUCKET WENT INTO
A BABY STROLLER.

6
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:36,000
BUT WATER WAS DRIPPING
ONTO THE FLOOR.

7
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:44,000
TWO DAYS LATER,
MISS HELEN WAS FOUND ALIVE.

8
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:52,000
AFTER QUARANTINE,
SHE RETURNED TO DISPLAY.
